# 📁 Raw Data Documentation (`row_data`)

This directory contains the source datasets used to build the **Sales Analysis & Business Intelligence Dashboard**. The raw data originates from enterprise transactional tables containing customer, product, regional, and sales history records.

---

## 📌 Datasets Overview

| File Name | Sheet Name(s) | Total Records | Columns | Primary Key | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`Customers.xlsx`** | `Sheet1` | 19,119 | 6 | `CustomerID` | Demographic details and contact information of registered clients. |
| **`Products.xlsx`** | `Sheet2` | 295 | 11 | `ProductID` | Catalog of items, categories, subcategories, cost, and pricing details. |
| **`Regions.xlsx`** | `Sheet1` | 10 | 4 | `TerritoryID` | Geographical mapping of sales territories, country codes, and regions. |
| **`Sales.xlsx`** | `2011`, `2012`, `2013`, `2014` | 121,318 | 10 | Composite / Line Item | Historical transactional sales line items across 4 calendar years. |

---

## 🔗 Data Schema & Relationships

The datasets follow a classic **Star Schema / Snowflake Schema** data model architecture:

* **Fact Table:** `Sales.xlsx` (Appended across all 4 yearly sheets)
* **Dimension Tables:**
  * `Customers.xlsx` linked via **`CustomerID`**
  * `Products.xlsx` linked via **`ProductID`**
  * `Regions.xlsx` linked via **`TerritoryID`**

```text
       ┌───────────────┐
       │   Customers   │
       └───────┬───────┘
               │ (1:N)
               ▼
┌─────────────────────────────┐         ┌───────────────┐
│         Sales (Fact)        │◄──(N:1)─┤   Products    │
└──────────────┬──────────────┘         └───────────────┘
               │ (N:1)
               ▼
       ┌───────────────┐
       │    Regions    │
       └───────────────┘
